<title>USA: Evergreen SD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Sec.</title>
<headline>Evergreen SD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities said it won $10 million of Evergreen SD, Calif., 1997 general obligation bonds, election of 1989 Series D, with a true interest cost of 5.512 percent.</p>
</text>
